ined across the fractions. The infectivity titres (PFU/ml, x) were determined for fractions 5&#x02013;9 only.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="gr2"/></fig><table-wrap id="tbl1" position="float" orientation="landscape"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Recovery rates of hRSV from continuous iodixanol gradients</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th/><th colspan="3" align="left">PEG-precipitated virus<hr/></th><th colspan="5" align="left">Continuous gradient<hr/></th></tr><tr><th/><th align="left">Volume<xref rid="tbl1fn1" ref-type="table-fn">a</xref> (ml)</th><th align="left">PFU/ml<xref rid="tbl1fn1" ref-type="table-fn">a</xref> (&#x000d7;10<sup>4</sup>)</th><th align="left">Total PFU<xref rid="tbl1fn1" ref-type="table-fn">a</xref> (&#x000d7;10<sup>4</sup>)</th><th align="left">Density (g&#x000a0;ml<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>)</th><th align="left">Volume (ml)</th><th align="left">PFU/ml<xref rid="tbl1fn1" ref-type="table-fn">a</xref> (&#x000d7;10<sup>4</sup>)</th><th align="left">Total PFU<xref rid="tbl1fn1" ref-type="table-fn">a</xref> (&#x000d7;10<sup>4</sup>)</th><th align="left">Recovery (%)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">R17532</td><td align="char">0.8</td><td align="char">64&#x000a0;&#x000b1;&#x000a0;5.66</td><td align="char">51.2&#x000a0;&#x000b1;&#x000a0;4.52</td><td align="char">1.15&#x02013;1.19</td><td align="char">1.5</td><td align="char">24.35&#x000a0;&#x000b1;&#x000a0;17.66</td><td align="char">36.52&#x000a0;&#x000b1;&#x000a0;35.92</td><td align="char">71</td></tr><tr><td align="left">N5843</td><td align="char">0.7</td><td align="char">3.23&#x000a0;&#x000b1;&#x000a0;0.24</td><td align="char">2.26&#x000a0;&#x000b1;&#x000a0;0.16</td><td align="char">1.15&#x02013;1.16</td><td align="char">0.9</td><td align="char">1.66&#x000a0;&#x000b1;&#x000a0;0.93</td><td align="char">1.49&#x000a0;&#x000b1;&#x000a0;0.30</td><td align="char">66</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbl1fn1"><label>a</label><p>Mean of two gradients, &#x000b1;Standard deviation.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>